    "intro": "Dreaming of crossing a river rarely means a simple trip from bank to bank — in Korean dream interpretation, it announces a decisive turning point in life. Glide across clear water in a boat and fortune is coming your way; struggle through muddy currents and something in your life deserves a closer look. The key is this: the condition of the water and the way you crossed can flip the meaning entirely.",
