        "heading": "Neutral — Reading the Signs of Change",
        "content": "Simply setting sail or traveling by boat is a neutral signal that an important life transition is imminent. Whether that change will be positive or difficult depends on the contextual details: the state of the water, the weather, the people accompanying you, and whether you reach your destination safely.\n\nA boat sitting quietly at anchor in harbor signals that this is a period for reflection and recalibration rather than aggressive forward motion. Rather than pushing ahead impulsively, the dream advises reviewing your current position carefully and preparing thoughtfully for the next phase of your journey."
      }
    ],
