    "h1": "Rainbow Dream Meaning: Korean Dream Interpretation",
    "intro": "In Korean dream interpretation, a rainbow dream is one of the most celebrated good omens you can receive. A brilliant, full-colored arc spanning the sky has long been read as a direct signal from the heavens — fortune is close, wishes are about to be granted, and something worth celebrating is on its way. But there is one important caveat: the same rainbow can carry a very different message depending on whether it is complete and vivid, or broken and fading.",
